<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- The ca2 answering brief's Word styles; fb render builds docx/reference.docx from pandoc's default reference with
     them (tools/fb/src/docxref.rs). They are the styles of the cross-engine layout model (lib/docx/xengine-reference.sh
     font="Times New Roman" size=28 body=628 single=400 indent=720 quote=280 note_after=140; docs/EVAL-LOOP.md,
     "Cross-engine gate"), matching typst/ca2-answering-brief.typ: Times New Roman 14 pt everywhere (FRAP 32(a)(5)(A);
     the typst face), theme fonts Times New Roman too; widow control on, no paragraph spacing by default; exact line
     boxes: body text and list items 31.4 pt (typst pitch-double, FRAP 32(a)(4)) with a 0.5 in first-line indent,
     block quotations and footnotes 20 pt (typst pitch-single), 14 pt around a quotation, 7 pt after a footnote;
     headings black and bold, links black. The cover, the tables, the headings as set, the signature and the
     certificates carry their own paragraph properties (docx/ca2.lua); the footers and the last section are fb
     render's (rIdFtrNone, rIdFtrPage, rIdFtrAdd; docx/ca2.lua writes FORMBOOK_FINAL). -->
